              {
                "text": "根据您的情况，如果您是FFEL借款人，在1998年10月7日或之后获得FFEL计划贷款之日没有未偿还的FFEL计划贷款余额，并且您拥有超过30,000美元的未偿还FFEL计划贷款，则您有资格为您的FFEL计划贷款选择延长还款计划。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Extended Plan | Federal Student Aid#1_0::c0000"
                ],
                "reason": "The context states the exact eligibility criteria for FFEL borrowers."
              },
              {
                "text": "该计划允许最长25年的还款期，每月还款额通常低于标准还款计划。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Extended Plan | Federal Student Aid#1_0::c0000"
                ],
                "reason": "The context states the repayment term and monthly payment characteristics."
              },
              {
                "text": "请注意，如果您同时拥有直接贷款，该计划仅适用于您的FFEL贷款，不适用于直接贷款。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Extended Plan | Federal Student Aid#1_0::c0000"
                ],
                "reason": "The context provides an example showing the plan applies only to FFEL loans when both exist."
